      "writtenOn": "2022-10-11T19:09:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I believe we need these annotations to have proper lint checks on these APIs. For example, if there\u0027s a module api method `void setMyInt(@MyIntDef int x)`, lint needs to know the `@MyIntDef` is applied to that argument so that it can validate you only pass correct int values to it. These annotations wouldn\u0027t appear in the public `annotations.zip` file because this method is module-only, we we need a module specific annotations.zip file.",
      "parentUuid": "998888de_404171d5",
      "revId": "869f3509c27c624fe9f719db3bec19bf0dd3b381",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
